quo;s 6 grids, May to June and August to September each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years. In 2025, August to September landed at 43% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 1965, and grid 25123 bottomed out at 65% that year.</p>"}
